    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Customize a Pie Chart\r\n\r\nUse color and emphasis to make a pie chart easier to interpret.\r\n\r\n1. Review the documentation for `colors` and `explode`. Each uses a list with one value for each chart slice, in the same order as `region_counts`.\r\n2. Run the program and review the printed order of the regions.\r\n3. Add a `colors` list to give each slice a different color.\r\n4. Add an `explode` list. Use `0.1` to emphasize one slice and `0` for the others. Run the program and verify that only the intended slice moves outward.\r\n\r\n:::: details [Need Help?]\r\n\r\nAsk AI Tutor to explain how to build a `colors` or `explode` list for `region_counts`. Make and test the changes yourself.\r\n\r\n::::",
    "ai_tutor_available": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false
    },
